{"title":"Warchief Ruk Gorehand","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Warchief Ruk Gorehand is a named <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-warchief\">Ogre Warchief</a> seen at level 54–61.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find Warchief Ruk Gorehand</h2>\n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>Inside <b>The Ogre Longhouse</b> <span class=\"muted\">· seen 87×</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"5405\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      \n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"warchief-ruk-gorehand\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>What it can drop</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/aa21c8eae0bb0e7f571f.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:6px\"><a href=\"#/item/gorehands-belly-plate-torso\"><b>Gorehand&#39;s Belly-Plate</b></a> <span class=\"muted\">(unique Titanium Torso, bound)</span>: <b>2%</b> of kills (1 in 50), <b>10%</b> from an elite (1 in 10). <span class=\"muted\">A kill heals you for 3% of your maximum hitpoints. +15% damage while you are below 40% hitpoints.</span></li><li><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/93d0a58e5998e4981375.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:6px\"><a href=\"#/item/bear-taker-longbow\"><b>The Bear-Taker</b></a> <span class=\"muted\">(unique Shagbark Longbow, bound)</span>: <b>2%</b> of kills (1 in 50), <b>10%</b> from an elite (1 in 10). <span class=\"muted\">+25% damage against a target at full hitpoints. A kill hastens you by 30% for 3 seconds.</span></li><li><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/ba0ed1b29406b77be707.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:6px\"><a href=\"#/item/ashkas-smoke-staff\"><b>Ashka&#39;s Smokestaff</b></a> <span class=\"muted\">(unique Shagbark Staff, bound)</span>: <b>2%</b> of kills (1 in 50), <b>10%</b> from an elite (1 in 10). <span class=\"muted\">15% of damage spells poison the primary target. A kill restores 10% of your maximum mana. An attack or spell that kills several monsters restores it once.</span></li>\n      <li><b>Gear every kill:</b> a piece from its tier, excellent or better, and a second piece 1 kill in 5.</li>\n      <li><b>Gold</b> worth about 5 ordinary kills.</li>\n      <li><b>Enchanted:</b> 1 kill in 100 enchants a piece (up to 9c, and only what its material can hold).</li>\n      <li><b>Elite:</b> a boss spawns elite 1 time in 100, and an elite makes its unique 5 times as likely.</li></ul>\n      <p class=\"muted\">From the game’s rules and its own guide. See <a href=\"#/guide/unique-items\">Unique items</a>.</p>\n      <h2>Drops players have recorded</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"ogrewax-knick\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b734a810757d0d5d1409.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogrewax Knick</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">70 drops</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">69 drops</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gem-topaz\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/03ef45d199ff9cf40c25.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gem Topaz</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">8 drops</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gem-iolite\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/5211b905fd0ac033ebac.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gem Iolite</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">6 drops</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+47 more\">+47 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-r